},{"client_msg_id":"f2e8dc1f-c2e3-4ee0-b16f-2474d2ff8e9f","type":"message","user":"UG6DF6W87","text":"その使い分けは私は業務用 PC と私用 PC でやってますねー","ts":"1619490993.072000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"3fZwf"}]},{"client_msg_id":"e3c226af-44d4-4c34-bf1a-f343fb98a09b","type":"message","user":"UKHUVMBJR","text":"作って壊してするための環境として使ってたな\nやっぱ壊せない環境でdotfilesいじるとどんどんメンテが滞って…","ts":"1619490907.070600","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"naruhodo","count":1,"users":["UG6DF6W87"]},{"name":"tashikani","count":2,"users":["UG6DF6W87","UD1FQV38V"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"J82JM"}]},{"client_msg_id":"932d4e3e-7cdc-4cd1-ad33-2dc8214cdaee","type":"message","user":"UG6DF6W87","text":"そうですねぇ、もしかしたら前紹介されてたように LXC/LXD のが要件にマッチする、みたいなこともあるかも","ts":"1619490835.069700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"oKd"}]},{"client_msg_id":"fa671ea9-d0c7-481a-9e63-832a3bc3ac9c","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"コンテナの最大のメリットの1つが不変性だから、開発(変更)を中でやるのがかなり嬉しくないのかもしれない\nコマンド相当とかポート公開とかで機能提供する分にはdockerいいんだろうけど","ts":"1619490759.068600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"SCD"}]},{"type":"message","user":"UKHUVMBJR","text":"\u003c@UKHUVMBJR\u003e has joined the channel","ts":"1619490538.067400","subtype":"channel_join","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":null},{"client_msg_id":"f208750a-cd5e-4c11-9b43-051224226239","type":"message","user":"UG6DF6W87","text":"そりゃ信用できないのでそうというのは全てにおいて...\nでも docker はやられたときの被害が大きくなるのでより注意しとく必要があるというのは同意\n3rd-party なやつはとりあえず Dockerfile を読みはしますが、大体隠蔽されてるんですよねー","ts":"1619490442.066400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"MCF"}]},{"client_msg_id":"527fdbc9-cb6b-4847-ba87-411c333e00c0","type":"message","user":"U01D44KSY9Z","text":"デプロイ用のDockerfileをカリカリにチューニングするという意味なら既存イメージを使うべきではないのは分かる","ts":"1619490402.065200","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"wakaru","count":1,"users":["UD1FQV38V"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"mIh"}]},{"client_msg_id":"6f5a3fe1-02c2-4632-9d8e-7fed3692feb5","type":"message","user":"U01D44KSY9Z","text":"手持ちのDockerfileで一番ニッチなやつは多分ojichat botかオレオレフィルター搭載したpandocイメージのどちらか","ts":"1619490331.063200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"1XG6"}]},{"client_msg_id":"d9a94ee6-a9ae-46f5-89d8-1090f4573d5a","type":"message","user":"UD1FQV38V","text":"Dockerfileのベストプラクティス != ローカル開発 in Dockerでどうすれば楽か、なんですよね\n開発用と動作するやつのDockerfileを一緒くたにしてはいけない...(戒め","ts":"1619490314.062900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"0zf"}]},{"client_msg_id":"9b94fcc9-9e70-4875-99d2-ea6711023630","type":"message","user":"U06ECBRTJ","text":"\u0026gt; カスタムイメージを使用する場合は、イメージのソースとDockerfileを確認し、自分でベースイメージをビルドしてください。パブリックレジストリで公開されているイメージが、与えられたDockerfileから本当にビルドされたものであるという保証はありません。また、イメージが最新の状態に保たれているという保証もありません。","ts":"1619490221.060300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"/4Hjq"}]},{"client_msg_id":"0350b013-2c0a-42d5-850f-5098e21b1fa6","type":"message","user":"U06ECBRTJ","text":"オフィシャルはまだいいことになってるか","ts":"1619490218.059900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"dsi/9"}]},{"client_msg_id":"631facdc-bb3b-4ea4-8efe-13a4eaad6271","type":"message","user":"U06ECBRTJ","text":"一応、このベストプラクティスだと、既存イメージは使うなって書いてる…","ts":"1619490186.058900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"/Vz"}]},{"client_msg_id":"d201882e-4a58-46cf-aa96-43ac95b92299","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":"既存イメージで物足りるなら、それを使う\n他に入れないといけないのがあるなら、Dockerfileを書く","ts":"1619490148.058600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"coFn"}]},{"client_msg_id":"747ecc8b-3901-4152-a672-e31b183b6588","type":"message","user":"U06ECBRTJ","text":"\u003chttps://sysdig.jp/blog/dockerfile-best-practices/\u003e","ts":"1619490134.058000","attachments":[{"fallback":"Sysdig: Dockerfileのベストプラクティス Top 20 | Sysdig","id":1,"title":"Dockerfileのベストプラクティス Top 20 | Sysdig","title_link":"https://sysdig.jp/blog/dockerfile-best-practices/","text":"Dockerfileのベストプラクティスのクイックセットをイメージビルドに適用することで、セキュリティ問題を防ぎ、コンテナ化されたアプリケーションを最適化する方法を学びます。 この記事では、Dockerfilesの記述とコンテナセキュリティに焦点を当てたDockerセキュリティのベストプラクティスのキュレーションされたリストにダイブして行きますが、イメージの最適化のような他の関連トピックもカバーしています。","thumb_url":"https://478h5m1yrfsa3bbe262u7muv-wpengine.netdna-ssl.com/wp-content/uploads/Dockerfile-best-practices-01.png","fields":[{"title":"Written by","value":"清水 孝郎","short":true},{"title":"Est. reading time","value":"5 minutes","short":true}],"blocks":null,"ts":1615349345,"service_name":"Sysdig","service_icon":"https://sysdig.jp/wp-content/uploads/2019/10/cropped-sysdig_favicon-1-180x180.png","thumb_width":1201,"thumb_height":661,"from_url":"https://sysdig.jp/blog/dockerfile-best-practices/","original_url":"https://sysdig.jp/blog/dockerfile-best-practices/"}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"YPP"}]},{"client_msg_id":"d20e956f-b993-4317-93d0-c318766d3293","type":"message","user":"U01D44KSY9Z","text":"postfixのイメージはこれっていうのがなくてたまに作ってる","ts":"1619490098.057200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"0MH7"}]},{"client_msg_id":"1149bc72-8e76-4b38-98ae-6c5efe09d064","type":"message","user":"UD1FQV38V","text":"稀によくあるレアケース(とは)","ts":"1619490084.056900","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"joy","count":1,"users":["UG6DF6W87"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"o4/4"}]},{"client_msg_id":"c8625a4a-30ae-4db0-8a3f-1788544876dc","type":"message","user":"UG6DF6W87","text":"あるある...","ts":"1619490063.056000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"A5Y"}]},{"client_msg_id":"283fcdda-c7c1-42e0-981b-3b0987585879","type":"message","user":"UD1FQV38V","text":"アプリケーション用の環境がないなぁ、作ってやらぁ! はあったけどレアケースですね...","ts":"1619490052.055700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"4Nf/G"}]},{"client_msg_id":"6b16cf3c-5bd8-49b3-a715-7cef59bb3d6a","type":"message","user":"UG6DF6W87","text":"構築されたイメージとやらが要件に合わないみたいな珍しいこともあるかもしれないですが、何もなければ構築済みのやつですねぇ... \u0026gt; alpine は使わないけど","ts":"1619490019.055200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"+mpg"}]},{"client_msg_id":"9295b22c-7354-4ce0-9229-59ee568a3ee6","type":"message","user":"U01D44KSY9Z","text":"構築済みのイメージが見つからない時とかもOSイメージから作るか","ts":"1619489983.053900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"B+SPg"}]},{"client_msg_id":"8db55ab5-88bc-4a03-8f8b-81299dd0da64","type":"message","user":"U01D44KSY9Z","text":"普通は構築済みのベースイメージをカスタマイズするんじゃないですかね\nそれ以上のチューニングする時かよほど特殊な環境作るのでもない限りOSのベースイメージは使わないと思います","ts":"1619489952.052200","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"wakaru","count":1,"users":["UD1FQV38V"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"GpY"}]},{"client_msg_id":"2bc275c2-0590-4086-b826-e2f5462ae207","type":"message","user":"U01AQ5BFNLX","text":"皆さんどっちですか？","ts":"1619489870.050100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"iBMt"}]},{"client_msg_id":"4c70901c-ecf0-45b3-8ef0-6ac56c29bf9a","type":"message","user":"U0